## D. Route access matrix (summary)

| Area | Logged out | Free plan | Paid plan |
|---|---|---|---|
| Landing, pricing, docs, public marketplace | ✅ full | ✅ full | ✅ full |
| Builder (basic layers) | ❌ redirect to signup | ✅ | ✅ |
| Builder (premium layers) | ❌ | 🔒 locked, upsell modal | ✅ |
| Backtest (historical) | ❌ | ✅ limited runs/month | ✅ unlimited |
| Live/paper trading monitor | ❌ | 🔒 | ✅ |
| Publish to marketplace | ❌ | 🔒 (or limited) | ✅ |
| Real-fund execution | ❌ | 🔒 | 🔒 separate opt-in tier w/ extra verification |

