## E. Global UI elements present across all `/app/*` routes

- **Top bar**: logo → `/app`, global search (Cmd/Ctrl+K), credits/plan badge → `/app/billing`, notification bell → `/app/notifications`, avatar menu → profile/security/logout
- **Left sidebar**: Dashboard, Builder (opens bot picker or last-edited bot), My Bots, Presets, Marketplace, Compare, Library, Billing, Help — collapsible to icon-only rail
- **Command palette** (Cmd/Ctrl+K): jump to any bot, preset, doc page, or action ("new bot", "run backtest")
- **Toast/notification system**: non-blocking confirmations (saved, unlocked, backtest complete)
- **Theme toggle**: light/dark, persisted per user